{"2794590":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Scam Line","steam_appid":2794590,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5030530],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Scam Line — a party game for 4–8 players<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/a79e4c084e0ffd98e8f241ccf618dba9.poster.avif?t=1793728821\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/a79e4c084e0ffd98e8f241ccf618dba9.webm?t=1793728821\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/a79e4c084e0ffd98e8f241ccf618dba9.mp4?t=1793728821\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Only One Will Win<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are locked in a room. You cannot see the others. You can only talk through an old mobile phone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust is optional. Survival is not.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scam Line is a multiplayer social game for 4 to 8 players where you compete in psychological and social challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All players are placed in separate rooms. Communication is limited. Information is power.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/b907f934fa322c578fd6470f483b5055.poster.avif?t=1793728821\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/b907f934fa322c578fd6470f483b5055.webm?t=1793728821\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/b907f934fa322c578fd6470f483b5055.mp4?t=1793728821\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In Early Access, the game features 22 social challenges, including:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Learn your neighbours’ room numbers before anyone else<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Identify who is dressed differently<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Play the classic Prisoner’s Dilemma<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• And many more…<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every challenge tests how well you can read people — and how well you can lie to them.<strong> <\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no right choices. Only consequences:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Form alliances<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Make deals<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Share information<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or choose a darker path:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Bluff<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Lie<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Manipulate<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, only one of you will win.<strong> <\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/2e0cd39723a70527b33978d2e4840154.poster.avif?t=1793728821\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/2e0cd39723a70527b33978d2e4840154.webm?t=1793728821\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/2e0cd39723a70527b33978d2e4840154.mp4?t=1793728821\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features <\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social deception 4-8 players gameplay<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice-based communication<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological mind games<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable player behavior<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple visuals, strong atmosphere<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAQ<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much does the game cost? <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the price of a cup of coffee.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New social multiplayer games release every day - why this one? <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scam Line focuses on deception, timing, and environmental surprises to create a truly unique social experience. You are an architect of your gaming experience. Based on your behaviour every run may become a unique adventure. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will it run on a potato PC? <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are there bugs? <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Scam Line — a party game for 4–8 players<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/a79e4c084e0ffd98e8f241ccf618dba9.poster.avif?t=1793728821\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/a79e4c084e0ffd98e8f241ccf618dba9.webm?t=1793728821\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/a79e4c084e0ffd98e8f241ccf618dba9.mp4?t=1793728821\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Only One Will Win<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are locked in a room. You cannot see the others. You can only talk through an old mobile phone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust is optional. Survival is not.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scam Line is a multiplayer social game for 4 to 8 players where you compete in psychological and social challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All players are placed in separate rooms. Communication is limited. Information is power.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/b907f934fa322c578fd6470f483b5055.poster.avif?t=1793728821\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/b907f934fa322c578fd6470f483b5055.webm?t=1793728821\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/b907f934fa322c578fd6470f483b5055.mp4?t=1793728821\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In Early Access, the game features 22 social challenges, including:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Learn your neighbours’ room numbers before anyone else<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Identify who is dressed differently<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Play the classic Prisoner’s Dilemma<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• And many more…<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every challenge tests how well you can read people — and how well you can lie to them.<strong> <\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no right choices. Only consequences:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Form alliances<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Make deals<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Share information<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or choose a darker path:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Bluff<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Lie<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Manipulate<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, only one of you will win.<strong> <\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/2e0cd39723a70527b33978d2e4840154.poster.avif?t=1793728821\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/2e0cd39723a70527b33978d2e4840154.webm?t=1793728821\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/extras\/2e0cd39723a70527b33978d2e4840154.mp4?t=1793728821\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features <\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social deception 4-8 players gameplay<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice-based communication<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological mind games<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable player behavior<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple visuals, strong atmosphere<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAQ<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much does the game cost? <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the price of a cup of coffee.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New social multiplayer games release every day - why this one? <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scam Line focuses on deception, timing, and environmental surprises to create a truly unique social experience. You are an architect of your gaming experience. Based on your behaviour every run may become a unique adventure. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will it run on a potato PC? <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are there bugs? <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Scam Line is a 4–8 player social deception game where your party will face different challenges. Become a liar, a manipulator, a cheater, or find your own path to victory","supported_languages":"English, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, French, Korean, German, Polish, Italian, Norwegian, Czech, Japanese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/86d84c71aadc3000e8719d3df387a0f11007ebcc\/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1793728821","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/3e7ad9634de7ca77bdd9ff7bf45e57f0e1516244\/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1793728821","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2794590\/3e7ad9634de7ca77bdd9ff7bf45e57f0e1516244\/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1793728821","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong>  Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel® Core™ i5-4670 (quad-core) \/ AMD® FX-Series™ FX-4350 (quad-core)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> integrated graphics card<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows® 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Proce